          .proof
            %h6#proof Proof
            %p
              A detailed proof for the statement as given is spelled out at
              = succeed "." do
                %em
                  %a{:href => "orbit+method#ThetaAsHomotopyFiberOfJ"} this proposition
            %p
              But this statement holds generally in
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohesive+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-toposes"} cohesive (∞,1)-toposes
              and an argument at this generality proceeds as follows: via the discussion at
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-action"} ∞-action
              the action of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
