                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Omega^1(-,\mathfrak{g})
              is the restricted action, the square on the right of
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
